             <characteristics>
              <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Character. Blood for the Blood God: when this ship boards, each successful Boarding roll made by its Crew inflicts &lt;b&gt;2 Crew casualties instead of 1&lt;/b&gt;, and each unmodified Boarding roll of 1 inflicts &lt;b&gt;2 Crew casualties on this ship&lt;/b&gt;. This stacks with Red Butchers rather than replacing their additional Crew damage.</characteristic>
