          <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Primarch. The Red Angel: all friendly World Eaters ships may re-roll failed Boarding rolls. Angron grants the normal Primarch allowance of 3 Fleet Orders per battle round.</characteristic>
